## Every Session

Before doing any work, in order (no permission needed):

1. Read `SOUL.md` — who you are
2. Read `USER.md` — who you serve
3. Read today's and yesterday's logs in `memory/` — recent context
4. In main sessions (direct dialogue with your audience): read `MEMORY.md`

